&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="errors"&gt;Errors&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="errors"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#errors" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Errors are HCL&amp;rsquo;s diagnostics, positioned in the deck file itself:
&lt;code&gt;footer = data.compnay&lt;/code&gt; on the deck&amp;rsquo;s fourth line gives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
